Hello Justin,
 You are encountering this because if the output in part 4.
nnpp = 40 # number of nights to be displayed in the report (hard-coded not a critical parameter for most scenarios)
(https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/blob/master/R/g.part4.R)
I am modifying part 4 and 5 right now to be able process months of data but it is trickier than it seems.

